From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pviano-ria <pviano@riasolutionsgroup.ai>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Grant InternalsVisibleTo to Gtk.Windows.Extensions

AutoClosingMessageBox moved out of the generated Forms library into the
hand-maintained Gtk.Windows.Extensions project, where it still needs
the library's internal NonStaticMessageBox.
---
diff --git a/Gtk.Windows.Forms/Gtk.Windows.Forms.csproj b/Gtk.Windows.Forms/Gtk.Windows.Forms.csproj
index 98435982..5c4c8cd9 100644
--- a/Gtk.Windows.Forms/Gtk.Windows.Forms.csproj
+++ b/Gtk.Windows.Forms/Gtk.Windows.Forms.csproj
@@ -45,6 +45,9 @@ Based on GTKSystem.Windows.Forms:
         <AssemblyAttribute Include="System.Runtime.CompilerServices.InternalsVisibleTo">
             <_Parameter1>Gtk.Windows.Forms.Tests, </_Parameter1>
         </AssemblyAttribute>
+        <AssemblyAttribute Include="System.Runtime.CompilerServices.InternalsVisibleTo">
+            <_Parameter1>Gtk.Windows.Extensions, </_Parameter1>
+        </AssemblyAttribute>
     </ItemGroup>
     <ItemGroup>
         <Compile Remove="GTKControls\Interface\**" />
-- 
2.53.0.windows.2

